<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Sepracor started buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Sepracor started buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities started coverage of Sepracor Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Paul Kelley said in a research report the company should have three more products on the market and $211 million in sales and royalty revenues in 2000, for projected $1.96 earnings per share.</p>
<p>-- He gave the company a $30 a share 12 month price target.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/8 to 14-3/4.</p>
</text>
